Package: concord-selfhost
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Concord Voice LLC <security@concordvoice.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: init-system-helpers, python3, iproute2, logrotate, openssl, ca-certificates
Recommends: docker-ce | docker.io, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2, git
Homepage: https://www.concordvoice.com
Description: Concord Voice self-hosted server and host agent
 Puts one pinned Concord Voice self-hosted release in /opt/concord, and runs
 the Concord Host Agent. Until the server is installed, the agent serves a
 setup wizard over HTTPS on port 9443; its address, with a one-time token, is
 in /run/concord-agent/setup-token.
